    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "Click threshold — disabled, previous behavior\nConnection status when device is disconnected\nDefault ring slot label\nDouble-click distance — disabled\nFeature disabled — drag threshold slider at minimum value\nFeature disabled — tip-up assist slider at minimum value\nPressure smoothing strength — disabled\nQuick Keys screen brightness level\nRing speed at minimum — rotation disabled\nRing/strip action: disabled\nStabilization strength — disabled\nTouch ring mode: disabled",
