          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接続されているタブレットには静電容量式タッチ面がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The issue comes pre-filled with your tablet's data. If it's too big for the form, drag the file in from Finder." : {
      "comment" : "Caption on the data-collection completion screen",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Issue ist mit den Daten deines Grafiktabletts vorausgefüllt. Wenn es zu groß fürs Formular ist, zieh die Datei aus dem Finder hinein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The issue comes pre-filled with your tablet's data. If it's too big for the form, drag the file in from Finder."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El issue se abre con los datos de tu tableta ya rellenados. Si son demasiado grandes para el formulario, arrastra el archivo desde el Finder."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作成されるIssueにはタブレットのデータが入力済みです。フォームに収まらない場合は、Finderからファイルをドラッグしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the Linux Wacom Project" : {
      "comment" : "Link label: the Linux Wacom Project (libwacom's parent project)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dem Linux Wacom Project"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "el Linux Wacom Project"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Linux Wacom Project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The taps don't line up with the targets. Applying this would map the cursor further from the pen tip than no calibration at all." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown under the high-residual calibration warning.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Tipp-Punkte stimmen nicht mit den Zielen überein. Diese Kalibrierung würde den Zeiger weiter von der Stiftspitze entfernen als gar keine Kalibrierung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The taps don't line up with the targets. Applying this would map the cursor further from the pen tip than no calibration at all."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los toques no coinciden con los objetivos. Aplicar esta calibración alejaría el cursor de la punta del lápiz más que no calibrar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "タップ位置がターゲットと一致していません。これを適用すると、キャリブレーションなしの場合よりもカーソルがペン先から離れてしまいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device has no pen tools.\nIts buttons are configured in the Buttons tab." : {
      "comment" : "Empty state shown in the tools list for an aux-only device like the Quick Keys puck",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Gerät hat keine Stiftwerkzeuge.\nSeine Tasten stellst du im Tab „Tasten“ ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este dispositivo no tiene herramientas de lápiz.\nSus botones se configuran en la pestaña Botones."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このデバイスにペンツールはありません。\nボタンは「ボタン」タブで設定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tablet doesn't report a usable USB ID, so a recording from it couldn't identify it." : {
      "comment" : "Capture error shown when the device's USB identifiers are missing or zero",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Grafiktablett meldet keine brauchbare USB-ID — eine Aufzeichnung könnte es also nicht identifizieren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This tablet doesn't report a usable USB ID, so a recording from it couldn't identify it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta tableta no informa de un ID USB utilizable, así que una grabación no podría identificarla."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このタブレットは有効なUSB IDを報告しないため、記録してもデバイスを特定できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tool will reappear with its default name next time the tablet detects it." : {
      "comment" : "Message explaining that removed tool nicknames are temporary",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Tool wird mit seinem Standardnamen angezeigt, wenn das Grafiktablett es das nächste Mal erkennt."
          }
